<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51355" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vŏlūtātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				rolling about</i>, <i>wallowing.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">totis volutationibus corporis aliquid persequi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Pis. 34, 83</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in luto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 51, 77, § 207</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pulverea athletarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Pall. 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caecā quādam volutatione
					contrahi undas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Prov. 1, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapidis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Jun. 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In
			partic., in mal. part., <i><span class="en">Petr. 95</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Sen. Contr. 1, 2 <i>med.</i></span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b> (post-Aug.). * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Restlessness</i>, <i>disquiet</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nusquam residentis animi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Tranq. 2, 8</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Instability</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tanta rerum humanarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 99, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
